    "Affected Files": "C:/Users/Usuario/.android/avd/tutor_tds_remote_catalog_qa.avd/config.ini (QA AVD only, outside repository)",
    "Structural Fix": "Enable GPU only in the newly created QA AVD, cold boot, wait for app rendering, use MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1 for Android device paths; never rebuild or reinstall the APK."
